    are released under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
    (CC BY 4.0) -- https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  * Trained model weights (model/checkpoints/) are released under
    CC BY 4.0. They are derived from PhysioNet ADFECGDB, which is distributed
    under the Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0 (ODC-BY 1.0).
    Attribution to the original database is required; see README.

  * Physiological recordings are NOT redistributed in this repository.
    Download them from PhysioNet with model/download_data.py and comply with
    the licence of each source database.

  * Full-text PDFs of the 30 surveyed publications are NOT redistributed.
    They remain the copyright of their respective publishers. This repository
    contains only bibliographic metadata, DOIs and our own analysis of them.

